der what  the hell's wrong with me when I say that  this is one of my favorite films of the  year but director yoga slam thermos has  such an original striking voice he made  the lobster and dogtooth and this film  is even darker than both of those  combined it stars Colin Farrell as a  doctor who strikes up a friendship with  a young boy played by Barry Keough and  they end up having almost a father-son  friendship and then it turns very very  dark indeed and threatens his entire  family I want to see one more thing I'm  really sorry about Bobby  it's nothing serious no it is Nicole  Kidman's also in the cast beautifully  shot well acted yes it will put you  through the wringer but once again I  think it is worth it  I'm sure you were all worried now about  my mental state but I just loved a movie  that really makes me feel something and  I want to know from you not about that  but about the Golden Globe nominations  what would the biggest snubs are the  biggest surprises for you let me know in  the comments below or on Twitter an  Alicia Malone and I'll see you next week  [Music]

